WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.326
Burkina Faso worodugu ni tileben fan fɛ, Banfora gɛrɛfɛ, dugukolo be yɛlɛla ka kɛ cɛncɛn kulujan ye.

00:00:08.406 --> 00:00:13.537
O yɔrɔ nunu ye Sindou kuluw ye: kɔɔw, sankasow ani kongosogow.

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:16.395
Sanji ni fɔɲɔ y'u dan tuma o tuma.

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:23.204
Dugukolo lɔnnikɛlaw y'a fɔ k'o cogo kabakomanw sababu ye kongosogow ɲagaminin ye.

00:00:23.284 --> 00:00:29.256
Nka, su donna Sindou dugu kan tuma min na, cɛkɔrɔbaw ye koo wɛrɛ lakali.

00:00:29.336 --> 00:00:34.131
Mɔgɔw b'a fɔ ko fɔlɔfɔlɔ, o faraw tun tɛ farakuru dama ye.

00:00:34.211 --> 00:00:39.174
Lɔnnikɛbaga dɔw tun siginin bɛ o yɔrɔ ra, o bɛɛ tun bɛ dogo.

00:00:39.254 --> 00:00:45.983
Mɔgɔ minw tun siginin be faraw jukɔrɔ, olu tun ka kan ka bɛn ni o kɔrɔsibagaw ye.

00:00:46.063 --> 00:00:51.447
O tun b'a yira ko u tun be se ka kɛnɛgbɛ sɛnɛ ani ka to hɛɛrɛ la.

00:00:51.527 --> 00:00:56.406
O kama, u b'a fɔ ko yɔrɔ dɔw la, mɔgɔ si tɛ se ka yɛlɛ yen.

00:00:56.486 --> 00:01:03.635
An t'a fɛ ka yɛlɛ yen tuma o tuma, an t'an kaan kɔrɔta, an tɛ taga n'an ka fɛɛn si ye.

00:01:03.715 --> 00:01:10.864
Mɔgɔ minw b'a baara kɛ, olu b'o kɛ ka barika la Ala ye, k'a ɲini a fɛ ko sanji ka ben.

00:01:10.944 --> 00:01:17.756
Lɔnnikɛla dɔw b'a miiri ko kabakuru kelen kelen bɛɛ be mɔgɔ hakili jigi koo dɔ la.

00:01:17.836 --> 00:01:23.640
O ye kɛlɛkɛcɛ dɔ ye, muso dɔ be kɔnɔni kɛra, kongosogo dɔ be sinɔgɔra.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:28.936
U bɛɛ k'o lɔn, k'u seko bɛɛ kɛ ka mɛnni kɛ diinan mɔgɔkɔrɔw fɛ.

00:01:29.016 --> 00:01:36.249
N'i ye deen ye kuluw kan, i be se k'a faamu k'o kabakuruw tɛ i n'a fɔ kabakuru dama ye.

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:40.536
Sisan, mɔgɔ caaman be bɔ yɔrɔjan ka na o yɔrɔ filɛ.

00:01:40.616 --> 00:01:45.411
O gafew b'u hakili jigi ko u be tagama yɔrɔ ɲanaman dɔ la.

00:01:45.491 --> 00:01:50.791
O yɔrɔ la, adamadenw ka koow cogoya n'u ka miiriyaw ye kelen ye.
